pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 36, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: HIGHLIGHTS · 综合篇
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 60, 760, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 第 7-8 课：打地鼠 + 综合大项目
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 112, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: l7-badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 138, 100, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 第 7 课
  - elementId: l7-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 168, 384, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 19
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 打地鼠游戏
  - elementId: l7-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 206, 384, 140]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 计时器、分数与随机出现逻辑</p>
        <p>· 用"三次提示法"写清游戏规则</p>
        <p>· 用 AI 迭代：加音效、加难度</p>
  - elementId: l7-out
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 352, 384, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$cyan"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: ▶ 产出：可计分的打地鼠网页游戏
  - elementId: divider-v
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [478, 138, 1, 310]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: l8-badge
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 138, 100, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 第 8 课
  - elementId: l8-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 168, 384, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 19
      color: "$text"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 综合大项目 + 班级路演
  - elementId: l8-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 206, 380, 140]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 自由选题：游戏 / 工具 / 个人网站</p>
        <p>· 全程用 Vibe Coding 开发，教师做顾问</p>
        <p>· 最后一小时：上台展示、同学互评</p>
  - elementId: l8-out
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 352, 380, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$cyan"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: ▶ 产出：个人综合项目 + 作品集
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 404, 832, 56]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
  - elementId: bottom-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 404, 784, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$muted"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>收官目标：学生独立完成"选题 → 提示词 → 生成 → 迭代 → 展示"的完整创作流程。</p>
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 500, 64, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 10 / 15
